holds)
  regraders     2 of 3 settle a challenge: 4bPGfRjE5EcJV4rBVikK9aRtNQq93ZDNycDGZSp7Yo5f, 
4WPAGT6wnJgxJzjcwnbFPM2vpVxaTExg9TzvWuhfQ6bn, 5pbKPw7uCN4ispJYKhw1voScjMkBDrij4G45WqQZftsp
  arbiter       2oyHAoA7m7owTCxTdrUrZe2zkGU7R7a1jwhRnhpJPiGw (decides a frozen escrow)

Its windows:

  challenge  0 s after the result is posted: anyone may challenge it with a different result and the same bond
  attest     172800 s (48 h) after the challenge window closes: from the first challenge until then the regraders 
re-run the grading and attest the result they reproduce; a challenger's result they back replaces the posted one only 
once this window ends
  hold       259200 s (72 h) after request_claim: the claim then needs no co-signature if no hold was placed
  claim      2592000 s (30 days) after the result becomes claimable: what is unclaimed then refunds

Its deadlines:

